## Architecture context (do not implement — awareness only)
The project has three major modules: UI, Conversation Strategy Module (CSM), and Recommendation Engine. Scraping feeds the Recommendation Engine's data store. The scraper has no awareness of these modules.

## Reference project
The old implementation lives at `../sitcom-ml-project/`. You may read files there for reference but do not copy them blindly — the new project makes deliberate changes. Key differences from the old project:
- No LangGraph pipeline
- No hardcoded episode registry (replaced by dynamic season discovery)
- No DB dependency in scraping
- Generic `FandomWikiProvider` (not Dunderpedia-specific)
- Cleaned `extracted_data.json` (no legacy transitional fields)
